{
  "v": 2,
  "order": 120,
  "label": "Computed columns & @",
  "group": "Tables",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "hdr",
      "type": "NoteNode",
      "x": -287,
      "y": 1917,
      "init": {
        "label": "Computed columns: define a column, don't type it",
        "body": "A table column can be **Data** (literal cells), a **Formula** (a row-wise expression stored on the column), or a **λ** wired in from outside. Excel's table rule applies: `@price` is *this row's* cell (`[@Price]`), a bare `price` is the *whole column* (`[Price]`) — so `@price * @qty` multiplies this row's two, and `@revenue / SUM(revenue)` is a share of the total. For names a variable can't spell, the brackets do both: `@[Unit Price]` is this row, `[Unit Price]` the whole column. Open the Sales table (click its chip) to see the per-column source selects; the chip's **ƒ** marks a table with defined columns.\n\nThe last group is the array form: **BYROW** and **MAP** take a LAMBDA as their argument and run it over a table, one row or one cell at a time.",
        "color": "blue",
        "width": 940,
        "height": 170
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "rule",
      "type": "LambdaNode",
      "x": 55,
      "y": 2518,
      "init": {
        "label": "Margin rule — its param names the column",
        "expr": "revenue * 0.25",
        "params": "revenue"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sales",
      "type": "FrameInputNode",
      "x": 384,
      "y": 2480,
      "init": {
        "label": "Sales",
        "frameText": "[{\"name\":\"price\",\"type\":\"number\",\"cells\":[\"120\",\"80\",\"45\",\"200\"]},{\"name\":\"qty\",\"type\":\"number\",\"cells\":[\"3\",\"7\",\"12\",\"2\"]},{\"name\":\"revenue\",\"type\":\"number\",\"cells\":[],\"expr\":\"@price * @qty\"},{\"name\":\"margin\",\"type\":\"number\",\"cells\":[],\"lambda\":\"fn1\"},{\"name\":\"share\",\"type\":\"number\",\"cells\":[],\"expr\":\"@revenue / SUM(revenue)\"}]",
        "lambdaKeys": [
          "fn1"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "noteA",
      "type": "NoteNode",
      "x": -261,
      "y": 2305,
      "init": {
        "label": "Three defined columns in one table",
        "body": "`revenue` is a **Formula** column — `@price * @qty`, stored on the column itself. `margin` is a **λ** column bound to the wired Margin rule: `LAMBDA(revenue, revenue * 0.25)`, whose parameter binds to *this row's* cell of the column it names — the λ's per-row interface. `share` mixes both reference kinds: `@revenue / SUM(revenue)` — this row's revenue over the whole column's total. Computed columns reference each other freely; evaluation is in dependency order.",
        "color": "green",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 175
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scale",
      "type": "ListInputNode",
      "x": 1123,
      "y": 2198,
      "init": {
        "label": "Scale — one value per row",
        "valueKeys": [
          "v0"
        ],
        "dataType": "number"
      },
      "stringLiterals": {
        "v0": "1, 2, 3, 4"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cc",
      "type": "ComputedColumnNode",
      "x": 1392,
      "y": 2131,
      "init": {
        "label": "Computed Column",
        "expr": "@revenue * @scale",
        "sideVars": [
          "scale"
        ]
      },
      "stringLiterals": {
        "name": "scaled",
        "after": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "out",
      "type": "DisplayNode",
      "x": 1721,
      "y": 2237,
      "init": {
        "label": "Sales + scaled"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "noteB",
      "type": "NoteNode",
      "x": 747,
      "y": 1975,
      "init": {
        "label": "@ over a wired list",
        "body": "Mid-pipeline, the **Computed Column** node adds `scaled = @revenue * @scale`. `revenue` is a column; `scale` isn't — an `@name` matching no column becomes a side input on this node, and the wired list is read **row by row** (it must line up: 4 values for 4 rows; a mismatch is a per-row `#SHAPE!`). A scalar wired there would read the same every row.",
        "color": "amber",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 185
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "grp-defined",
